      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Node logs — warnings & errors (Loki)",
      "description": "Live warning/error/notice log lines from every quod node. Each node emits one JSON object per log event to stdout (quod_log_formatter); promtail ships it under {job=\"docker\"} and Loki's | json exposes level/msg/node_id. node_id (kp_…) names the emitting instance — the same id as the $node picker above. Query: {job=\"docker\"} |~ \"node_id\" | json | node_id=~\"kp_.+\" | level=~\"warning|error|notice\".",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
